    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2054570/extras/d82cf50df673edb424ac96d11a6fbeb0.avif?t=1665816506\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2054570/extras/f70fa29d1a77f425231da1092b1988a5.poster.avif?t=1665816506\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2054570/extras/f70fa29d1a77f425231da1092b1988a5.mp4?t=1665816506\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Explore the world Missions Monsters Dungeons Battles Magic Brave Demon lord Magic. Participate to help the adventurers within the guild. to help the adventurers roam the fantasy world. Exploration is an integral part of the game, allowing new dungeons, monsters, and territories to be discovered. and encounter unexpected events with the adventurers<br><br>Management of the Adventurer's Guild<br>-Create missions for adventurers, hunt monsters, explore the world, build dungeons Including the rewards that will be received after completing the mission.<br>-Buy everything the adventurer sells. Monster Fragments, Ore, Books, Weapons<br>-Summon heroes from other worlds to join the Adventurers Guild.<br>-Selling textbooks, fighting skills, and providing training facilities<br>-Research: Bring monster parts to research armor, weapons, potions<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2054570/extras/2aadefe072d747e20a49c03f951760f1.poster.avif?t=1665816506\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2054570/extras/2aadefe072d747e20a49c03f951760f1.mp4?t=1665816506\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Summon the adventurers from other worlds.<br></li><li>Create quests for adventurers.<br></li><li>Explore the area and meet new monsters.<br></li><li>Prioritize the adventurer group.<br></li><li>Prevent hordes of monsters from attacking towns and villages.<br></li><li>Research Potions Weapons Armor Skills Magic</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2054570/extras/28ed53bf1d93b9b1b0852fe9b4c4fee3.poster.avif?t=1665816506\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2054570/extras/28ed53bf1d93b9b1b0852fe9b4c4fee3.webm?t=1665816506\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br>Swordsman | Archer | Magician | Priest | Barbarian | Gunman | Hitman | Berserk | Knight | Hero | Shieldman | Magic Swordsman | Demon Lord<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2054570/extras/46372223987e65557c58bed528f7d3a3.poster.avif?t=1665816506\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2054570/extras/46372223987e65557c58bed528f7d3a3.webm?t=1665816506\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2054570/extras/46372223987e65557c58bed528f7d3a3.mp4?t=1665816506\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
